:35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QValueTransition.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QValueTransition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QValueTransition","kind":"structure","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/QValueTransition.lean#L29-L52","doc":"Data for the mass-difference form of a `β⁻`-decay `Q`-value.\n\nA carrier for the realised form, not the primary definition (see the\nmodule header): the nucleon/electron masses, the binding energy\n`B(Z,N)`, the neutral-atomic mass `M(Z,N)` pinned to its formula, and the\n`Q`-value pinned to the parent–daughter mass difference. ","signatureChunk":0}]}